Do not add completion functions (_*) to this directory.

This fpath addition happens in funcs.zsh which compiles after completions.zsh,
meaning compinit has already run by the time this directory is added to fpath.
Completion functions placed here will not be found.

Put completion functions in /opt/homebrew/share/zsh/site-functions or create
a dedicated completions directory that gets added to fpath before compinit.
